text Naranja_SinNombre_G25_M41_Text_08199007 {
    "This ferry is built to plow through\nfast-running currents.\pWe hope you enjoy your voyage with us.\nFeel free to explore the ship."
}

text Naranja_SinNombre_G25_M41_Text_08199088 {
    "We hope you enjoy your voyage on\nour ferry."
}

text Naranja_SinNombre_G25_M41_Text_081990B4 {
    "We have made land in SLATEPORT CITY.\nThank you for sailing with us."
}

text Naranja_SinNombre_G25_M41_Text_0819913B {
    "It’ll be some time before we make land,\nI reckon.\pYou can rest up in your cabin if you’d\nlike. Your cabin’s No. 2.\pThe bed in there is soft and plushy.\nI can attest to how comfy it is!"
}

text Naranja_SinNombre_G25_M41_Text_081991F4 {
    "We’ve arrived!"
}

text Naranja_SinNombre_G25_M41_Text_08199203 {
    "Go visit other cabins.\nTRAINERS bored of the boat trip will\lbe itching to battle."
}

text Naranja_SinNombre_G25_M41_Text_08199255 {
    "Enjoy your cruise!"
}

text Naranja_SinNombre_G25_M41_Text_08199268 {
    "The horizon spreads beyond the\nporthole."
}

text Naranja_SinNombre_G25_M41_Text_08199291 {
    "MR. BRINEY: Welcome aboard, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\pThey made me honorary captain of the\nS.S. TIDAL!\pYou can call me CAPTAIN BRINEY now!\pYou know, I retired once before, but\nwhen I saw this majestic ship...\pLet me just say, it stirred my sleeping\nsoul as a sailor!"
}

text Naranja_SinNombre_G25_M41_Text_08199388 {
    "PEEKO: Pihyo pihyohyo..."
}

text Naranja_SinNombre_G25_M41_Text_081993A1 {
    "Cabin 1"
}

